  "title": {
   "en": "Kuroneko no Kenshi ~Black na Party wo Yametara S-kyuu Boukensha ni Scout Saremashita. Imasara \"Modotte kite\" to Iwaretemo \"Mousoi\" desu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "黒猫の剣士～ブラックなパーティを辞めたらS級冒険者にスカウトされました。今さら「戻ってきて」と言われても「もう遅い」です～"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kuroneko no Kenshi ~Black na Party o Yametara S-kyuu Boukensha ni Scout Saremashita. Imasara \"Modotte kite\" to Iwaretemo \"Mousoi\" desu~"
   },
   {
    "en": "Black Cat Swordfighter"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Treated as incompetent → In fact, the strongest adventurer! Magic value is 1, which is as close to 0 as possible, and the lowest adventurer rank, \"F\". Nine spends his days as a vanguard (attacker) in a party that has found him, but he and his beloved cat, Enu, are forced to do all the chores.\n\nHowever, one day, the leader sells off the black sword, a memento of Nine's father, without permission, and even uses violence against his precious Enu and Nine's patience reaches its limit! \"I'm quitting now!'' Nine, determined to leave the party and start a new life, is suddenly confronted by an S-rank adventurer \"Dahlia of Flash''. And then he is scouted by the strongest party on the continent, \"Red Hawk\"...?",
   "ja": "無能扱い→実は最強の冒険者！魔力値が限りなく0に近い1、冒険者ランク最低の「F」。なんとか拾ってもらったパーティの前衛（アタッカー）として暮らすナインは、愛猫のエヌと共に、雑用を一手に押しつけられる不遇な日々を送っていた。しかし、ある日リーダーにナインの父の形見である黒刀を勝手に売り払われ、さらに大事なエヌにまで暴力を振るわれ、ナインの我慢は限界に達する！「もう、辞めます！」　パーティを飛び出し、新たな人生を送る決意をしたナインの前に突如現れたのは、Sランク冒険者『閃光のダリア』。そして大陸最強パーティ『紅鷹』にスカウトされて――!?"
  },
